Path parameters are strings, read from req.params (Requirement 7.1, 7.2).

### one parameter
GET /graves/13
=> 200

{"id": "13"}

### another value
GET /graves/vlad
=> 200

{"id": "vlad"}

### two parameters
GET /crypts/north/graves/7
=> 200

{"crypt": "north", "grave": "7"}

### a parameter is one path segment
GET /graves/13/extra
=> 404

{"error": "ROUTE NOT FOUND IN THIS REALM"}
